WEBVTT

01:37.750 --> 01:38.730
Haré!

01:39.610 --> 01:41.220
Hurry up and eat your breakfast!

01:41.220 --> 01:42.580
You'll be late for school!

01:42.850 --> 01:43.680
Okay!

01:44.850 --> 01:47.980
It's good that we have such
beautiful weather today.

01:48.060 --> 01:48.520
Yeah.

01:48.720 --> 01:51.250
It would be horrible if it rained on a fine
starting day like today.

01:51.730 --> 01:53.990
A first day just has to be this way.

01:54.330 --> 01:56.760
What? First day? Of what?

01:57.770 --> 02:00.330
Are you ready, Guu-chan?

02:04.710 --> 02:06.470
Oh, you're so cute!

02:06.570 --> 02:08.540
But, is it a bit too plain?

02:09.240 --> 02:11.040
What's up with that outfit!?

02:11.150 --> 02:12.240
I dressed her up.

02:12.310 --> 02:14.370
After all, this is Guu's school debut.

02:14.520 --> 02:16.310
School debut?

02:16.480 --> 02:18.470
I've already talked it over with the teacher.

02:18.620 --> 02:19.590
But...

02:22.920 --> 02:24.410
To school? In that outfit?

02:24.490 --> 02:25.050
Yeah.

02:26.560 --> 02:27.720
Just imagine.

02:27.830 --> 02:31.960
A transfer student wearing clothes
like that and saying hello with a very cute
look on her face.

02:33.430 --> 02:37.670
It's true that Guu made a face like this in the
very beginning...

02:38.370 --> 02:40.110
Hello, I'm Guu.

02:40.110 --> 02:41.100
Nice to meet you!

02:42.940 --> 02:43.600
See?

02:43.680 --> 02:47.110
As the school idol,
she'd brighten up the classroom!

02:47.180 --> 02:51.640
A tremendously wonderful mood-maker Guu
will be! I can just picture it!

02:51.820 --> 02:54.290
Are you sure you're not mistaking that with a
troublemaker?

02:54.390 --> 02:55.360
Did you say something?

02:55.460 --> 02:56.350
Nothing important.

02:56.560 --> 02:57.650
Now, Guu-chan.

02:57.830 --> 03:01.390
If there's something, anything, you don't
understand at school, ask Haré.

03:05.130 --> 03:06.190
Anything?

03:06.300 --> 03:07.070
Yup.

03:07.070 --> 03:08.900
Leave everything up to Haré.

03:14.070 --> 03:17.200
You know,
I really don't want to go to school anymore.

03:17.850 --> 03:20.410
Now, you take good care of Guu-chan!

03:21.020 --> 03:21.980
Um...

03:22.520 --> 03:24.010
What? Did you forget something?

03:25.620 --> 03:27.690
I have a slight headache...

03:27.690 --> 03:29.820
Is it alright if I stayed home
instead of going to school?

03:30.020 --> 03:31.390
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

03:31.690 --> 03:33.560
Are you sure it's not just simple muscle
cramps?

03:33.860 --> 03:36.090
Do you think you can get
muscle cramps up in your head?

03:36.300 --> 03:37.560
Or rather...

03:39.200 --> 03:43.930
You think you can fool your own mother with
that pathetic level of acting?

03:44.070 --> 03:45.440
Well, yeah...

03:45.940 --> 03:47.670
Have a good day!

03:47.740 --> 03:48.610
Yeah.

03:48.810 --> 03:50.300
Now...

03:52.510 --> 03:53.780
Time for sleep!

03:54.550 --> 03:57.480
Siesta Guu Guu

04:06.860 --> 04:09.020
She's always so quiet...

04:09.130 --> 04:11.650
It really makes me choke up.

04:12.030 --> 04:14.560
Would it be better if I tried to talk to her?.

04:14.740 --> 04:17.570
It'd be good if there was something in
common to talk about...

04:20.440 --> 04:22.110
Hey, Guu, do you know what that is?

04:22.110 --> 04:23.510
It's called a pokute.

04:23.610 --> 04:24.340
What the...?

04:26.180 --> 04:29.170
Well, I guess it was just my imagination.

04:38.760 --> 04:41.820
The air around me is getting heavier...

04:43.530 --> 04:46.190
Isn't there a good way...?

04:46.670 --> 04:48.000
Hey, do you know what that is?

04:48.100 --> 04:49.660
It's called a longarm monkey...

04:49.740 --> 04:50.570
What the...?

04:51.910 --> 04:54.310
Why? Why do they disappear?.

04:56.440 --> 04:58.640
I-I-It can't be.

04:58.750 --> 05:00.010
That's right.

05:00.080 --> 05:03.680
Even if Guu was this really mysterious
person... that just can't be.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.980
They just all went away before I noticed it.

05:06.190 --> 05:07.280
I'm sure, I'm sure that's what it was.

05:07.550 --> 05:08.680
Hey have you ever seen an elephant...

05:08.760 --> 05:09.750
It really disappeared!

05:09.820 --> 05:10.950
Why!?

05:11.020 --> 05:13.990
Where do they keep disappearing to,
one after another?.

05:16.160 --> 05:19.860
I-I-It can't be...
All of them..? Guu..?

05:20.100 --> 05:21.570
No that's not possible.

05:21.870 --> 05:23.530
It's definitely impossible.

05:23.670 --> 05:31.080
Is it just me,
or did all the birds stop singing?

05:33.880 --> 05:35.640
No. It's not just me.

05:36.120 --> 05:40.350
It's as if all the animals in the jungle went
away somewhere...

05:40.690 --> 05:43.090
Is this Guu's fault as well?

05:43.590 --> 05:44.750
Guu did all of this..?

05:45.260 --> 05:46.820
That means, next up...

05:47.900 --> 05:48.730
...is me?

05:48.830 --> 05:49.760
Hello.

05:52.600 --> 05:54.790
Don't get so close to me without warning!

05:54.900 --> 05:55.770
What's this?

05:59.140 --> 06:00.870
Oh, this is called a turtle.

06:01.310 --> 06:02.610
If yo

06:04.710 --> 06:08.740
He's really scared of things,
and hides inside his shell really quickly.

06:08.850 --> 06:11.370
There really are people like this out there,
faint-hearted people.

06:12.050 --> 06:13.950
Wait, that's what I am!

06:14.490 --> 06:15.320
Hello?

06:16.890 --> 06:19.980
If you worry about things you don't need to,
you'll die sooner than you think.

06:20.090 --> 06:21.690
Is she warning the turtle?

06:22.400 --> 06:24.190
Have a bigger heart.

06:24.630 --> 06:27.000
To me!? With that Kansai dialect?

06:33.640 --> 06:35.270
We're finally here.

06:36.580 --> 06:40.710
This is the town elder's great-great-great-
great-great-great-great-great-great-great-
grandfather.

06:41.050 --> 06:42.710
He's the one that built this school.

06:46.020 --> 06:47.180
Guu, what's wrong?

06:47.550 --> 06:48.580
Hurry up and come over here.

06:51.930 --> 06:54.390
This is the shoebox, though we've never
used it.

06:54.900 --> 06:57.020
And this is the drinking fountain.

06:57.700 --> 06:58.790
The bathroom is over there.

06:59.230 --> 07:01.290
And beyond that is the teacher's room.

07:01.470 --> 07:03.060
I'm sure the teacher is waiting, too.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.430
Hey, where are the clothes you had been
wearing?

07:05.610 --> 07:06.400
I have them.

07:06.670 --> 07:07.400
Where?

07:09.510 --> 07:11.540
No, no, you don't need to show me!

07:13.580 --> 07:15.210
What's wrong? You look glum.

07:15.550 --> 07:18.810
You know, I'm going to beg you.
Don't cause anymore commotion.

07:19.090 --> 07:21.180
You're the one
that's making all the commotion.

07:21.990 --> 07:24.630
It might seem that way from the outside...

07:24.630 --> 07:27.760
...but it's all because of how you are,
Guu, and how you act.

07:27.760 --> 07:29.990
That really disrupts my feelings...

07:30.100 --> 07:31.330
Why don't you say so more clearly?

07:32.330 --> 07:34.060
That attitude!
I'm talking about that attitude!

07:34.130 --> 07:36.300
Can you do something
about that attitude of yours?

07:47.610 --> 07:48.880
I give up.

07:49.950 --> 07:51.080
So tiring...

07:52.550 --> 07:54.580
And so, this is the teacher's room.

07:55.090 --> 07:55.950
Now, go in.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.860
I'll go on ahead, but you can come later with
the teacher, Guu.

07:59.030 --> 07:59.820
See ya.

08:20.610 --> 08:23.140
Was it a good thing to leave Guu behind?

08:26.150 --> 08:28.560
I'm worrying about things too much.

08:28.560 --> 08:30.520
Wait. But I'm still worried...

08:39.670 --> 08:40.830
That can't be!

08:44.040 --> 08:44.700
All right.

08:53.180 --> 08:56.150
Stop it! Let go of our teacher!

08:56.480 --> 08:58.850
I said let go!

09:02.120 --> 09:03.350
Oh, it's you, Haré.

09:03.590 --> 09:05.390
What are you doing there?

09:05.790 --> 09:08.520
I-I brought over the transfer student...

09:09.430 --> 09:10.560
Transfer student?

09:10.630 --> 09:12.290
Oh, that's right, I heard about that.

09:12.800 --> 09:14.290
And, where is the student?

09:16.140 --> 09:18.100
It's nice to meet you. I'm Guu.

09:18.670 --> 09:20.570
Oh, rather cute!

09:21.010 --> 09:22.310
It's nice to meet you, teacher!

09:22.380 --> 09:25.680
I'm Lazy. Nice to meet you.

09:26.150 --> 09:27.280
Oh well.

09:27.280 --> 09:29.810
It looks like he hasn't caught onto anything.

09:30.620 --> 09:32.780
Then, I'll be waiting in the classroom.

09:32.920 --> 09:35.110
Yeah, we'll be right over.

09:38.090 --> 09:40.820
I'm sleepy.
I wonder if I should take another nap.

09:43.830 --> 09:44.990
Don't sleep!

09:45.170 --> 09:46.150
I won't sleep.

09:46.270 --> 09:47.600
You look fretful. What's wrong?

09:48.540 --> 09:49.800
So tiring...

09:56.480 --> 09:58.910
HARÉ+GUU

10:02.520 --> 10:03.710
Morning.

10:06.490 --> 10:07.890
Morning, Haré!

10:08.860 --> 10:09.840
Oh, morning, Marie.

10:09.990 --> 10:11.690
Hey, Haré, are you doing well?

10:11.990 --> 10:14.030
I don't think so.

10:14.030 --> 10:16.020
Too many things happened this morning.

10:16.130 --> 10:16.990
I see.

10:17.100 --> 10:18.890
Hey, I've heard, I've heard.

10:18.970 --> 10:20.830
There's going to be a transfer student
coming in today?

10:21.100 --> 10:23.300
And she lives in your house, right Haré?

10:23.770 --> 10:24.960
Who'd you hear that from?

10:25.070 --> 10:26.200
My big brother.

10:26.510 --> 10:28.800
Oh, from Lazy-sensei.

10:29.110 --> 10:31.100
What, what?. What are you talking about?

10:31.280 --> 10:33.440
About the transfer student I was talking
about earlier.

10:33.750 --> 10:35.310
Oh, I hear that it's a girl?

10:35.420 --> 10:36.310
What kind of girl is she?

10:36.550 --> 10:37.350
Is she cute?

10:38.190 --> 10:40.620
Well... She's cute, or rather...

10:41.660 --> 10:43.750
How in the world should I be answering this?

10:44.220 --> 10:45.280
Nice to meet you!

10:46.030 --> 10:46.820
That's right!

10:46.890 --> 10:49.230
I'm sure she'll have that look when she
comes here, so...

10:50.060 --> 10:52.960
Well, let's see, she's really cute.

10:53.030 --> 10:53.500
Really?

10:53.500 --> 10:54.370
But, you know, she's slightly...
Really?

10:54.370 --> 10:54.840
But, you know, she's slightly...

10:54.840 --> 10:56.170
But, you know, she's slightly...
Hey, he said she's really cute!

10:56.170 --> 10:56.790
Hey, he said she's really cute!

10:56.870 --> 10:59.000
Great, great! I want to see her now!

10:59.070 --> 11:00.510
Listen to what people say
until they're done talking!

11:01.240 --> 11:03.900
Hey, come on. Everyone be seated.

11:04.780 --> 11:06.370
It's the teacher...

11:06.850 --> 11:07.810
Now then...

11:12.050 --> 11:13.490
Lazy-sensei?

11:15.920 --> 11:17.250
Hey, wake up! He's asleep...

11:21.330 --> 11:22.960
Oh, sorry, sorry.

11:23.200 --> 11:25.820
It must be because of spring.
I'm just so sleepy.

11:25.970 --> 11:28.160
There's no concept of spring
or summer in a jungle.

11:29.170 --> 11:29.690
Now...

11:31.910 --> 11:33.500
Open your math textbooks!

11:34.880 --> 11:36.470
Hey don't be so dazed!

11:36.540 --> 11:38.480
Don't be acting stupid now!

11:38.880 --> 11:40.710
Where's the transfer student?

11:41.280 --> 11:42.980
Oh, my mistake.

11:43.280 --> 11:45.550
I've been dazed and forgot about that.

11:46.020 --> 11:46.640
Hey!

11:58.730 --> 12:01.760
W-W-Why hasn't she changed her face?

12:02.400 --> 12:04.670
But well, I guess this is all right.

12:05.010 --> 12:08.740
If she uses this face from the beginning, it
means I don't need to explain further.

12:09.080 --> 12:11.040
I guess I still need to.

12:11.380 --> 12:13.640
Hey, this isn't what you've told us.

12:13.710 --> 12:15.010
"Really cute"

12:15.080 --> 12:16.740
What part of her is, eh?

12:17.920 --> 12:22.750
But, if Guu can properly introduce herself,
this awful atmosphere will blow away...

12:22.990 --> 12:24.820
Well...

12:24.990 --> 12:27.860
C-Can you introduce yourself?

12:29.500 --> 12:31.860
Guu. Nice to meet you.

12:33.570 --> 12:35.760
Oh, she's so unfriendly!

12:37.040 --> 12:38.970
I'm really sorry!

12:39.640 --> 12:42.440
Now, about her seat...

12:45.010 --> 12:47.450
I'm sure Guu would like to be
near someone she knows.

12:47.680 --> 12:49.210
How about she sits next to Haré?

12:50.180 --> 12:50.950
Um..!

12:51.380 --> 12:55.340
I'll sit one row back, next to Marie,
so Guu can sit in this seat!

12:56.960 --> 12:58.360
I-I see.

12:59.230 --> 13:01.490
Yay! I'm next to Haré!

13:02.660 --> 13:05.460
I don't want to be next to Guu,
even in school.

13:05.770 --> 13:07.160
I can't stand it!

13:08.100 --> 13:10.160
So, first period is...

13:26.450 --> 13:30.550
W-W-Well...

13:31.260 --> 13:32.250
Hey, Marie.

13:33.130 --> 13:34.680
Change seats with Guu.

13:35.660 --> 13:36.750
Sure, but why?

13:36.830 --> 13:40.230
W-Well, I think she's better off next to Haré
after all.

13:41.870 --> 13:43.560
So it ends up like this after all...

13:44.940 --> 13:45.840
Let's be friends.

13:46.570 --> 13:50.980
So, I was planning first period to be math,
but I'm making a change of plans.

13:51.410 --> 13:52.310
I'm calling it a siesta.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.180
Why is that?.

13:56.850 --> 13:58.180
Because I'm sleepy.

13:58.990 --> 14:00.180
There's no other reason.

14:00.490 --> 14:01.020
Well...

14:01.020 --> 14:02.490
Good night.

14:04.860 --> 14:06.790
Do people usually have a
siesta in the morning?

14:07.160 --> 14:08.180
Good night!

14:08.830 --> 14:09.400
I guess I'll take a nap too.

14:09.400 --> 14:10.200
I guess I'll take a nap too.
I'm not sleepy at all.

14:10.200 --> 14:10.230
I'm not sleepy at all.

14:10.230 --> 14:11.600
Hey, don't take the spot next to Ravenna!
I'm not sleepy at all.

14:11.600 --> 14:12.260
Hey, don't take the spot next to Ravenna!

14:12.370 --> 14:13.600
First come, first served.
If you lay down maybe you'll fall asleep
eventually.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.270
Hey!
If you lay down maybe you'll fall asleep
eventually.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.360
If you lay down maybe you'll fall asleep
eventually.

14:16.270 --> 14:19.640
Hey, where did you transfer from, Guu?

14:19.910 --> 14:21.930
Oh, I've been wondering about that myseIf.

14:22.310 --> 14:23.400
Did you come from the city?.

14:24.080 --> 14:25.870
What's your full name? And your birthday?

14:25.950 --> 14:27.610
What's your blood type?

14:28.950 --> 14:30.780
Guu sure is under questioning...

14:35.060 --> 14:36.720
I don't know what's going on,
but Guu is burning?

14:39.360 --> 14:41.620
These guys are annoying pests!

14:43.700 --> 14:45.030
Stop it!

14:46.000 --> 14:48.520
Be quiet! If you don't, you'll wake up those
that are already asleep!

14:51.140 --> 14:51.930
But...

14:52.470 --> 14:55.810
And see, Guu just transferred over here,
so she's tired.

14:56.180 --> 14:57.470
Right, Guu?

14:58.610 --> 14:59.510
See?

15:00.010 --> 15:01.070
That's true.

15:01.180 --> 15:02.340
Everyone, let's go to sleep.

15:02.420 --> 15:03.710
Oh, so boring.

15:12.060 --> 15:14.290
Somehow I got through this.

15:16.000 --> 15:18.230
I hope nothing else happens now.

15:18.900 --> 15:20.490
Good night.

15:38.720 --> 15:39.710
Pee...

15:44.890 --> 15:45.550
Huh?

15:46.790 --> 15:48.730
Where did everyone go?

15:50.130 --> 15:51.690
Hey?

15:52.370 --> 15:53.830
Guys?

15:57.840 --> 15:58.960
That's strange.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.730
Where did they all go?

16:01.610 --> 16:03.340
Hey, guys!

16:06.580 --> 16:08.480
Hey!

16:12.420 --> 16:13.980
HEY!

16:14.450 --> 16:16.790
GUYS!

16:20.790 --> 16:22.990
Where did they all go?

16:30.470 --> 16:32.060
Even the statue is gone!

16:32.470 --> 16:34.460
Who in the world would do such a thing?

16:34.540 --> 16:35.970
Wait, it has to be her!

16:36.880 --> 16:38.240
She got all of them!?

16:45.090 --> 16:47.210
Guu, where are you?

16:59.400 --> 17:00.420
The second floor?

17:05.610 --> 17:06.970
Hey!

17:07.410 --> 17:08.670
Guu?

17:09.580 --> 17:10.370
Guu!

17:12.650 --> 17:15.640
Dammit, where did Guu go?

17:24.660 --> 17:27.090
The weather is turning ugly.

17:30.100 --> 17:30.930
Is that you, Guu?

17:56.860 --> 17:58.260
I-Is it just me?

18:04.630 --> 18:07.100
W-Wait! I can explain!

18:07.200 --> 18:10.530
When you're relaxed is when you're in the
most danger.

18:11.040 --> 18:12.940
I'm not asking about that!

18:13.370 --> 18:14.200
Then what?

18:14.470 --> 18:15.910
What did you do with everyone?

18:16.080 --> 18:16.870
Everyone?

18:17.110 --> 18:18.770
Everyone in our class!

18:23.620 --> 18:27.350
E-Even though everyone's questioning was
annoying... all of them?

18:28.050 --> 18:29.390
That can't be!

18:29.790 --> 18:33.230
Even you, Guu, wouldn't do such a thing,
right?

18:35.090 --> 18:35.890
Right.

18:43.340 --> 18:44.130
That's right.

18:44.470 --> 18:47.500
I woke up because I wanted to go pee.

18:48.210 --> 18:51.510
First, I'll get what needs to come out, out of
my system, then I'll think about it.

18:55.550 --> 18:57.570
Oh, Haré, you're already up?

18:58.520 --> 18:59.580
Good timing.

18:59.650 --> 19:03.750
When you get back to the classroom,
wake everyone up and tell them to come to
the cooking room.

19:04.960 --> 19:05.980
I'll leave it to you.

19:08.330 --> 19:10.760
Lazy-sensei was all right...

19:13.300 --> 19:15.890
I was so surprised that I
peed a little bit in my pants...

19:16.770 --> 19:21.300
Tell them?
I can't help if there's nobody to tell...

19:22.510 --> 19:25.240
It seemed really realistic for a dream.

19:25.310 --> 19:26.510
I liked her. She seemed nice.

19:26.510 --> 19:27.880
W-Why?
I liked her. She seemed nice.

19:29.450 --> 19:31.250
There was a bird, too! A bird!

19:31.420 --> 19:32.440
Yes, there was.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.880
I didn't see it!

19:33.950 --> 19:36.220
It doesn't matter if there was one or not.

19:36.220 --> 19:37.880
It's a dream after all.

19:37.960 --> 19:40.080
Eh? You're just going to
let it end as a dream?

19:40.160 --> 19:41.790
Let's be more imaginative, Gupta.

19:41.860 --> 19:43.060
That's right, that's right!

19:44.100 --> 19:46.190
Hey, Haré, where have you been?

19:46.730 --> 19:48.860
Oh, I went to the bathroom.

19:50.900 --> 19:54.030
Huh? Maybe it was all my
misunderstanding?

19:54.370 --> 19:56.540
That's right, I'm pretty sure it is.

19:56.610 --> 19:57.870
That's just what it was!

19:58.080 --> 20:01.980
Geez, I was really surprised that you guys
were all gone when I woke up.

20:02.050 --> 20:05.210
Where were all of you guys playing around,
leaving me behind?

20:05.690 --> 20:07.650
We were all asleep right here.

20:08.520 --> 20:10.320
We all woke up just a minute ago.

20:10.760 --> 20:13.160
Y-You're serious?

20:13.260 --> 20:15.930
And, back to what I was saying...

20:15.930 --> 20:17.990
That guy Seiichi was really handsome!

20:18.200 --> 20:19.790
S-Seiichi?

20:21.130 --> 20:25.940
I like Tomoyo-san. She's older than me,
but spacy and really cute.

20:26.410 --> 20:27.430
Tomoyo!?

20:28.780 --> 20:31.470
I-I-It can't be!

20:32.080 --> 20:34.550
H-Hey, what are you guys talking about?.

20:34.780 --> 20:35.870
Our dream.

20:35.980 --> 20:37.070
It's strange.

20:37.150 --> 20:38.880
We all had the same dream.

20:38.950 --> 20:40.040
Same dream?

20:40.950 --> 20:43.080
What's wrong? You look pale.

20:43.390 --> 20:45.360
It...really...is...

20:46.930 --> 20:48.530
You swallowed them!

20:48.530 --> 20:48.760
What?
You swallowed them!

20:48.760 --> 20:49.280
What?

20:49.400 --> 20:51.420
Maybe someone drank the milk
he had saved for later?.

20:52.100 --> 20:53.220
That would get him mad.

20:55.230 --> 20:58.030
Don't get anyone other
than me involved in this!

20:58.100 --> 20:58.800
I went through...

21:00.840 --> 21:02.240
I went through all the effort
of spitting them back out.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.200
Oh well.

21:05.140 --> 21:06.410
I'll swallow them up again.

21:07.450 --> 21:10.180
No! Absolutely not!

21:10.950 --> 21:13.010
No, stop, I'm sorry!

21:13.090 --> 21:14.280
Wait, why do I have to apologize?

22:34.970 --> 22:36.070
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.070 --> 22:38.570
The furry-chest-haired elder is teaching us during
our cooking class.

22:38.570 --> 22:40.110
Oh, it figures that Toposte is a good cook.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.970
Hey, Guu, don't do anything strange.
And while I say that why are you going against me?

22:41.970 --> 22:43.640
Wait, what are you slicing up!? Geez...

22:43.640 --> 22:45.080
Hey, wait! What was that scream?

22:45.080 --> 22:45.280
E-Elder! What's wrong?

22:45.280 --> 22:46.470
E-Elder! What's wrong?

22:46.550 --> 22:47.750
Argh, your chest hair!!

22:47.750 --> 22:49.440
The hunt is cancelled. The elder is shocked
by all this and collapses...

22:49.520 --> 22:53.080
Mom and Guu are dancing some groove
despite the fact that this village's elder is in
bed and I hear that tonight is the key point in
his health.

22:53.150 --> 22:54.850
Oh elder, rest in peace...

22:54.920 --> 22:58.490
And so there are problems
all over the place, but putting them all aside,
the biggest question is...

22:58.490 --> 22:59.690
Guu, what's up with that wig!?

22:59.790 --> 23:00.030
Go with chest Hair!

23:00.030 --> 23:02.030
Next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:02.030 --> 23:03.060
"GO with Chest Hair!"

23:03.060 --> 23:04.460
It's full of chest hair!

23:04.460 --> 23:04.900
Go with Chest Hair!
